<%- include('../partials/page-start') %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>Built on integrity. Delivered with precision.</h1>
    <p style="max-width:65ch;">
      Ephphatha Concepts Limited is a dynamic, professionally managed Nigerian company specializing
      in construction, building design, renovation, fashion, and general supply services. Registered
      with the Corporate Affairs Commission of Nigeria (Reg. No. <%= site.contact.cac.regNo %>),
      we deliver high-quality residential, commercial, and industrial projects with a strong
      commitment to excellence, durability, safety, and client satisfaction.
    </p>
    <p style="max-width:65ch;">
      Our team consists of skilled engineers, builders, designers, project managers, craftsmen,
      and fashion professionals dedicated to delivering projects that meet modern standards and
      client expectations.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stitch-line container" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="section section--muted">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-card__index">Vision</span>
        <h3>Where we're headed</h3>
        <p>To become a leading and trusted construction, fashion, and supply company known for quality, innovation, and reliability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-card__index">Mission</span>
        <h3>How we get there</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Deliver superior construction and supply services</li>
          <li>Provide innovative building and fashion solutions</li>
          <li>Ensure timely project completion</li>
          <li>Maintain the highest standards of professionalism and safety</li>
          <li>Build long-term client relationships based on trust</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-card__index">Core Values</span>
        <h3>What guides us</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Integrity</li>
          <li>Quality Assurance</li>
          <li>Professionalism</li>
          <li>Innovation</li>
          <li>Accountability</li>
          <li>Customer Satisfaction</li>
          <li>Safety</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Governance</span>
      <h2>Policies we operate by</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Quality Policy</h3>
        <p>Our documented systems conform, as a minimum, to the standards of BS EN ISO 9001:2000, with internal audits and periodic management review to continually improve service delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Health, Safety &amp; Environment</h3>
        <p>Site inspections, regular safety meetings, ongoing workforce training, and comprehensive healthcare provisions guide our commitment to an accident-free working environment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Environmental Policy</h3>
        <p>We minimize waste, promote recycling, and work toward an environmental management system satisfying the requirements of ISO 14001:2004.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stitch-line container" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="section section--muted">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span>
      <h2>Board of Directors</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Arin Sunday Ajiji</h3>
        <p><strong>MD/CEO</strong> — HND (Business and Management)</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= site.contact.email %>"><%= site.contact.email %></a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Kaze Arin Ashi</h3>
        <p><strong>Project Officer</strong> — BSc, MSc, PhD (in view), EIA, ESS, Climatology</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Arc. Chuwang Kefas Gyang</h3>
        <p><strong>Architect &amp; Project Manager</strong> — BSc, MSc</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Want to work with us?</h2>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Get in Touch</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/page-end') %>
